nic serum. - Hair that breaks because it''s sensitive to perm hair styles. - Hair that needs intensive care for damaged hair. [Capacity] 70g. [How to use it] [How to use it] 1. Dry a towel after shampooing. 2. Take out an appropriate amount and use it for damaged hair. 3. Dry. [Option] Extreme Damage Clinic Serum 70g #kerasys #Hair #Haircare #Keratin #Ceramide #Oil #Damage #Nutrition #DeepCare #Serum -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- ♡Three Promises of koksara.kbeauty 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.√ 2.We sell 100% genuine.√ 3.Chatable time: All the time [24/7].√', 80.0, 59.3, NULL, 'Beauty > Hair Care > Hair Treatment', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-7repk-m2q8icr80lq12c', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F14928017058', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
