a tabela acima!"', 129.99, 78.99, NULL, 'Baby & Kids Fashion > Boy Shoes > Sneakers', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-7r98o-m6r8dizepvlc64', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F908041635%2F23798232702', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
