 Removedor de painel reto: 205 mm x 17 mm 1 Removedor plano para painel: 205 mm x 30 mm 1 Chave para clipe: 130 mm 1 Chave para clipe: 205 mm 1 Alicate para clipe 5 Chaves para rádio automotivo', 214.1, 119.9, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Vehicular Tools > Others', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-820m1-mqdrx65qp1xe4e', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F333540705%2F14384794891', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
